146	 * (an optional `view.` / `window.` / `globalThis.` receiver is allowed — a content
147	 * script constructing an event for another frame's document must use THAT window's
148	 * constructor). Returns `{ name, index, args, init }`, where `init` is the second
149	 * argument's object literal, or null when the call passes no init literal at all.
150	 */
